=== intro

One of the crew hasn't been sleeping. You find them in the observation deck at 0300, staring at the void. They don't respond when you speak.

"It's watching," they whisper finally. "The dark between the stars. It's alive. It's been alive all along."

Void-sickness. Happens to haulers who spend too long in the black.

* [Get the medic] { crew.medical }
  ~ morale += 5
  ~ chronicle "Treatment"
    Void-sickness caught early. The medic administered sedatives and light therapy. They'll recover.
  -> END

* [Talk them down yourself]
  ~ morale -= 3
  ~ chronicle "The Long Dark"
    Talked a crew member through a void-sickness episode. Not easy. The dark gets to everyone eventually.
  -> END

